~ start

Mysterious Box: [[Hello there!|Greetings, traveler!|Oh, a visitor!]]
Mysterious Box: I am the Mysterious Box of this diorama.
Mysterious Box: I was created to test Nathan Hoad's Dialogue Manager!
- Who placed you here?
	Mysterious Box: A curious developer who wanted to see if we could converse.
	Mysterious Box: And look at us now! It works wonderfully.
	=> questions
- Tell me a secret about this garden.
	Mysterious Box: Lean in close...
	Mysterious Box: The foliage and trees around us are rendered with 3D Gaussian Splats!
	Mysterious Box: Pretty cool technology, isn't it?
	=> questions
- Can you change your color?
	Mysterious Box: Watch this!
	do change_color()
	Mysterious Box: Ta-da! How do you like this new look?
	=> questions
- Goodbye.
	Mysterious Box: Farewell! Feel free to talk to me anytime.
	=> END

~ questions
Mysterious Box: Is there anything else you'd like to ask?
- Tell me a joke!
	Mysterious Box: Why did the computer squeak?
	Mysterious Box: Because someone stepped on its mouse! Haha!
	=> questions
- Change your color again!
	do change_color()
	Mysterious Box: Presto chango! Another fresh coat of paint.
	=> questions
- That's all for now.
	Mysterious Box: Have a wonderful stroll through the garden!
	=> END
